      "@type": "BackgroundKnowledge",
      "instance_name": "Genocide",
      "label": "Genocide",
      "description": "Genocide is the deliberate and systematic destruction of a racial, political, or cultural group. The Holocaust is the most infamous example of genocide. The meme's juxtaposition of a mundane act with genocide trivializes the suffering of victims and reduces the gravity of genocide to a joke.",
